          No! That is the greatest strength of this tool. Your financial accounts never touch third-party aggregators (like Plaid or Yodlee). You enter your high-level numbers once a month manually in 90 seconds.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
        <summary class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex justify-between items-center list-none">
          <span>Can I customize the categories?</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Yes! The spreadsheet is 100% unlocked for your personal use. You can rename categories, add custom sinking funds, or change the target safe withdrawal rate as your life evolves.
        </p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom Checkout CTA Bar -->
    <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold">
        <span>⚡ Early Access: {product.earlyBirdPrice} ({product.earlyBirdLimit})</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black">Own Your Wealth &amp; Cash Flow Operating System</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
